WEBVTT

00:03:55.606 --> 00:04:00.278
I was working with the board
of a health care organization.

00:04:00.319 --> 00:04:02.530
And in the coffee break,

00:04:02.571 --> 00:04:07.618
they started to talk about an employee
who'd been pretty vocal

00:04:07.660 --> 00:04:11.914
on the internal comms channels
about climate change,

00:04:11.914 --> 00:04:16.127
and he was quite critical
of what the organization had been doing.

00:04:17.128 --> 00:04:20.381
It was really interesting,
because some of the executives

00:04:20.381 --> 00:04:23.134
labeled him as a troublemaker,

00:04:23.134 --> 00:04:25.344
kind of wanted to get rid of him.

00:04:25.928 --> 00:04:31.100
But there were a few executives
that saw him as a trailblazer,